{"id":"u-19d51499-33a6-4b21-bde8-af4114fcace0","src":"community","title":"NAT5 : Advanced Hypertrophy Blueprint","author":"Brahma Bull","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/y0KJDz-nat5-advanced-hypertrophy-blueprint","desc":"NAT5: Advanced Hypertrophy Blueprint\nEngineered for Growth. Designed for Naturals.\nThis is more than a workout — it’s your roadmap to elite-level muscle development.\nBuilt specifically for natural athletes, this 5-day advanced hypertrophy program delivers maximum gains with intelligent recovery — no wasted reps, no fluff, just pure, scientific growth.\n🔥 What Makes NAT5 Different?\n🎯 Targeted Volume for every major muscle group\n💡 Science-backed Supersets that maximize time & hypertrophy\n⚖️ RPE-Driven Intensity to keep you progressing without burning out\n🧬 Advanced Split Design to balance power, aesthetics, and longevity\n📅 Weekly Game Plan Breakdown\nDay 1 – MONDAY: Leg Power & Density (Quads, Glutes, Calves)\nHeavy squats. Deep unilateral overload. A calf protocol that actually works.\n💥 Back Squats + Bulgarian Splits = Explosive strength & unilateral depth\n🔥 Leg Press Volume = Peak hypertrophy stimulus\n🔥 High-Rep Calves = True finishing fatigue\nStart the week by attacking the legs — the largest anabolic driver.\nDay 2 – TUESDAY: Upper Push Attack (Chest, Shoulders, Triceps)\nChest expansion, capped delts, and triceps that pop.\n⚡ Incline Press <-> Lateral Raise Superset = Mass + width\n💪 Bench + Overhead Dumbbell Press = Upper-body pressing synergy\n🎯 Triceps Finisher Superset = Stretch + squeeze domination\nSupersets optimized to blow up your push muscles and flood them with volume.\nDay 3 – THURSDAY: Posterior Chain Domination (Glutes, Hamstrings, Lower Back)\nGet strong. Get stable. Get thick.\n🔩 RDLs + Hip Thrusts = Glute-hamstring mass\n🧨 Walking Lunges + Curls = Joint health + stretch-mediated hypertrophy\n🔥 Single-Leg Calves = Even lower leg growth\nThis is where your physique becomes functional and aesthetic.\nDay 4 – FRIDAY: Upper Pull Precision (Back Width, Thickness, Rear Delts)\nBuild that V-taper and dense posterior you can feel.\n💥 Pull-up <-> Face Pull Superset = Width + scapular control\n🛠️ Barbell & Cable Rows = Deep back engagement\n🎨 Optional Curl Finisher = Arm definition + blood volume\nNothing builds authority like a powerful back. This day does just that.\nDay 5 – SATURDAY: Aesthetic Mastery (Arms, Abs, Glutes, Calves)\nRefine your physique and target every overlooked detail.\n🎯 Arm Supersets = Maximum pump in minimal time\n🔥 Cable Crunches = Core thickness + visible abs\n⚙️ Giant Set for Delts & Glutes = Symmetry + postural muscle flow\n👣 Calves Reloaded = High-frequency growth protocol\nYou earned this day — now finish the week sculpting your masterpiece.\n💪 Ideal For:\nExperienced natural lifters\nPhysique athletes & body recomposition goals\nLifters ready to take the guesswork out and train smarter\n🚀 NAT5 = Results Without Reliance\nNo shortcuts. No enhancers. Just a well-engineered blueprint for real, sustainable muscle growth.","level":["Advanced","Intermediate"],"goals":["Women's","Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":80,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-03-14T12:34:48.940Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Lower A","Upper Push","Lower B","Upper Pull","Aesthetic day"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Hack Squat","sets":[{"r":7,"rpe":7,"x":4}]},{"n":"Bulgarian Split Squat (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Leg Press","sets":[{"r":9,"rpe":7,"x":4}]},{"n":"Seated Calf Raise","sets":[{"r":15,"rpe":7,"x":3}]},{"n":"Standing Calf Raise","sets":[{"r":15,"rpe":7,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"ss":[{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":8,"x":4}]}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Shoulder Press (Machine)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Tricep Rope Push Down (Cable)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":8,"x":2}]},{"n"